OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1788570294
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G6/8
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The death toll in the food poisoning
OL,6, outbreak at a psychiatric hospital in
OL,7, Wakefield, Yorkshire, has risen to 18.
OL,8,F
OL,9,FThe deaths of seven more patients at
OL,10,Fthe Stanley Royd Hospital were reported
OL,11,Ftoday. Most of the dead were elderly.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FThe outbreak has affected 300 patients
OL,14,Fand several dozen members of staff.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FInquests on 15 victims have been opened
OL,17,Fand adjourned for a fortnight pending
OL,18,Ffurther investigations.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FThe local health authority says the
OL,21,Finfection has passed its peak but the
OL,22,Fexact cause is still not known.
OL,23,F                     D]CFrom 05-09-84
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
