OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1788570294
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G7/8
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The US space shuttle Discovery has
OL,6, returned safely to earth after a six-
OL,7, day mission.
OL,9,FThe crew of six astronauts made a
OL,10,Fperfect landing at Edwards Air Force
OL,11,Fbase in California at 1338 GMT.
OL,13,FThey successfully launched three
OL,14,Fcommunications satellites during the
OL,15,F2.5 million mile trip.
OL,17,FThe flawless testing of a 10-storey
OL,18,Fsolar sail could lead to the use of the
OL,19,Fconcept for supplying electricity to a
OL,20,Fpermanent US space station. A machine
OL,21,Fto process biological material in space
OL,22,Fwas also tested successfully.
OL,23,F                     D]CFrom 05-09-84
